{"articleNo":"174666","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=174666&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"Rotman-UNIST Trading Competition 2017 대회 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.06.21","hit":"2968","attachments":[{"name":"Rotman-UNIST Trading Competition 2017 홍보자료.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=174666&attachNo=76545"},{"name":"트레이딩대회 포스터.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=174666&attachNo=76611"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: rgb(23,6,144)\"><strong>Rotman-UNIST Trading Competition 2017</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: rgb(23,6,144)\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: rgb(23,6,144)\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(58,50,195)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&lt;대회진행&gt;</span></span></span></strong><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">가상 거래 플랫폼인 Rotman Interactive Trader(RIT)와 실제 트레이딩 케이스를</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">활용하여 참가팀 간 모의 트레이딩 방식으로 경쟁함.</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">※ RIT연습용 서버 및 케이스는 향후 홈페이지를 통해 공개</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: rgb(58,50,195)\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">&lt;참가사항&gt;</strong></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- 팀 단위 지원(3인 1팀)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- 트레이딩에 관심있는 대학생 및 대학원생</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- 참가비용 : 무료(숙식 및 기타제공, 단 왕복교통비 자비부담)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- 숙소 : UNIST 학생 기숙사</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: rgb(58,50,195)\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">&lt;접수 및 상세정보&gt;</strong></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- 홈페이지를 통한 온라인접수 : 국제에너지트레이딩연구센터(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><a href=\"http://ciet.unist.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">http://ciet.unist.ac.kr</a></font></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp; UNIST 융합경영대학원(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\"><a href=\"http://gstm-kor.unist.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\">http://gstm-kor.unist.ac.kr</a></font></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">☞</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: rgb(58,50,195)\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,239,0)\"><u><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSemEWAxbZjnwhnNUJxxeKXFjjDGsK2VGqpPFb5mVwGdLa3QFw/viewform\" target=\"_blank\">신청하기</a></u></span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0)\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><u>마감 : 2017년 7월 14일(금)</u></strong></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- 최우수상, 우수상, 장려상 : 상패 및 부상</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 참가자 전원 : 참가확인증 및 기념품&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(58,50,195)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">* 대회케이스</span></span></span></strong><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- Social Outcry Case</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">- Sales &amp; Trader Case</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">-&nbsp;Algorithmic Trading Case</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">-&nbsp;Commodities Trading Case</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">-&nbsp;Electricity Trading Case&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(58,50,195)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&lt;참가팀 공지&gt;</span></span></span></strong><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(255,0,0)\"><u>2017년 7월 18일(화)</u></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(58,50,195)\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(58,50,195)\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&lt;문의&gt;</span></span